---
// src/pages/user/tickets.astro — Dashboard Tiket & Event Saya
import UserLayout from "../../layouts/UserLayout.astro";
---

<UserLayout title="Tiket & Event Saya" activeMenu="tickets">
  <div class="tickets-container">
    <!-- Header Card -->
    <div class="dash-card header-card">
      <div class="header-info">
        <h1 class="dash-card-title">Tiket & Event Saya</h1>
        <p class="dash-card-subtitle">
          Kelola tiket seminar dan webinar Anda, pantau status verifikasi, akses tautan ruangan Zoom, serta klaim e-sertifikat dan slide materi pembelajaran.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Summary Stats -->
      <div class="ticket-stats-grid">
        <div class="t-stat-card">
          <span class="t-stat-num"><span data-n="all">0</span></span>
          <span class="t-stat-lbl">Total Tiket</span>
        </div>
        <div class="t-stat-card active-card">
          <span class="t-stat-num"><span data-n="verified">0</span></span>
          <span class="t-stat-lbl">Tiket Aktif / Lolos</span>
        </div>
        <div class="t-stat-card waiting-card">
          <span class="t-stat-num"><span data-n="waiting">0</span></span>
          <span class="t-stat-lbl">Menunggu Verifikasi</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Filter Pills -->
    <div class="ticket-filter-bar">
      <div class="filter-pills" id="ticket-pills">
        <button class="t-pill active" data-filter="all">Semua (<span data-n="all">0</span>)</button>
        <button class="t-pill" data-filter="verified">Terverifikasi (<span data-n="verified">0</span>)</button>
        <button class="t-pill" data-filter="waiting">Menunggu (<span data-n="waiting">0</span>)</button>
        <button class="t-pill" data-filter="rejected">Ditolak</button>
      </div>

      <a href="/event" class="btn-browse-events">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line>
          <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
        </svg>
        Cari Event Baru
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Ticket List -->
    <div class="tickets-list" id="tickets-list"><p>Memuat tiket...</p></div>
  </div>

  <template id="empty-template">
      <div class="dash-card empty-card">
        <div class="empty-icon">🎟️</div>
        <h3>Belum Ada Tiket Acara</h3>
        <p>Anda belum terdaftar pada agenda seminar atau workshop mana pun saat ini.</p>
        <a href="/event" class="btn-primary-empty">Jelajahi Agenda & Webinar EduTech →</a>
      </div>
  </template>
  <template id="ticket-template">
    <div class="ticket-card">
      <div class="ticket-main">
        <div class="ticket-top">
          <div class="ticket-badges">
            <span class="t-badge badge-verified" data-when="verified">✓ Tiket Aktif / Terverifikasi</span>
            <span class="t-badge badge-waiting" data-when="waiting">⏳ Menunggu Verifikasi Pembayaran</span>
            <span class="t-badge badge-rejected" data-when="rejected">✕ Pendaftaran Ditolak</span>
            <span class="t-badge badge-tier"></span>
          </div>
          <span class="reg-date"></span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="event-title"><a></a></h3>
        <div class="event-meta-grid">
          <div class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Jadwal Acara</span><span class="meta-value" data-f="date"></span></div>
          <div class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Lokasi / Platform</span><span class="meta-value" data-f="venue"></span></div>
          <div class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Nama Peserta</span><span class="meta-value" data-f="name"></span></div>
          <div class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Total Pembayaran</span><span class="meta-value" data-f="total"></span></div>
        </div>
        <div data-when="waiting"><div class="ticket-notice waiting-notice">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                      <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                    <span>Bukti pembayaran sedang diverifikasi oleh admin (maksimal 1x24 jam). Tautan Zoom dan sertifikat akan aktif otomatis setelah disetujui.</span>
                  </div>
</div>
        <div data-when="rejected"><div class="ticket-notice rejected-notice">
                    <span>Mohon maaf, bukti pembayaran tidak dapat divalidasi. Silakan hubungi admin di support@edutech.id untuk bantuan lebih lanjut.</span>
                  </div>
</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ticket-stub">
        <div class="stub-notch notch-top"></div>
        <div class="stub-notch notch-bottom"></div>
        <div class="stub-content">
          <span class="stub-label">KODE TIKET</span>
          <div class="stub-code-wrap">
            <strong class="stub-code"></strong>
            <button type="button" class="btn-copy-code" title="Salin Kode Tiket">Salin</button>
          </div>
          <div class="barcode-graphic" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <div class="stub-actions">
            <button type="button" class="btn-ticket btn-print-ticket" data-when="verified"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                            <polyline points="6 9 6 2 18 2 18 9"></polyline>
                            <path d="M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"></path>
                            <rect x="6" y="14" width="12" height="8"></rect>
                          </svg> Cetak E-Tiket</button>
            <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-ticket btn-cert" data-when="verified"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                              <circle cx="12" cy="8" r="7"></circle>
                              <polyline points="8.21 13.89 7 23 12 20 17 23 15.79 13.88"></polyline>
                            </svg> Klaim Sertifikat</a>
            <button type="button" class="btn-ticket btn-material" data-when="verified"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                              <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path>
                              <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline>
                              <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
                            </svg> Materi & Slide</button>
            <span class="status-tip"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </template>

  <!-- Print Ticket Modal -->
  <div id="print-modal" class="modal-backdrop" style="display: none;">
    <div class="modal-card print-ticket-card">
      <div class="ticket-print-header">
        <div class="print-brand">Edu<span>Tech</span> ID</div>
        <span class="print-tag">E-TICKET RESMI</span>
      </div>

      <div class="print-body">
        <h2 id="print-event-title" class="print-event-title">Judul Acara</h2>
        <div class="print-grid">
          <div class="p-item"><span>Nama Peserta:</span><strong id="print-name">-</strong></div>
          <div class="p-item"><span>Email:</span><strong id="print-email">-</strong></div>
          <div class="p-item"><span>Jadwal:</span><strong id="print-date">-</strong></div>
          <div class="p-item"><span>Lokasi/Platform:</span><strong id="print-venue">-</strong></div>
          <div class="p-item"><span>Jenis Tiket:</span><strong id="print-tier">-</strong></div>
          <div class="p-item"><span>Status:</span><strong style="color: #2dc653;">TERVERIFIKASI RESMI</strong></div>
        </div>

        <div class="print-code-box">
          <span>KODE TIKET UNIK</span>
          <h1 id="print-code">TIC-XXXXXX</h1>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="print-modal-actions no-print">
        <button type="button" class="btn-modal-print" onclick="window.print()">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <polyline points="6 9 6 2 18 2 18 9"></polyline>
            <path d="M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"></path>
            <rect x="6" y="14" width="12" height="8"></rect>
          </svg>
          Cetak / Simpan PDF
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-modal-close" id="btn-close-print">Tutup</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Materials Modal -->
  <div id="material-modal" class="modal-backdrop" style="display: none;">
    <div class="modal-card">
      <h3 id="mat-event-title" class="modal-mat-title">Materi & Slide Acara</h3>
      <p class="modal-mat-sub">Unduh slide presentasi dan materi pendukung resmi dari pembicara.</p>
      
      <div id="mat-list" class="mat-list"></div>

      <div class="mt-4">
        <button type="button" class="btn-modal-close" id="btn-close-mat" style="width: 100%;">Tutup</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Client-side Interactive Logic -->
  <script>
    import { clone, createdAt, el, formatDate, getJSON, safeHref, setText } from '../../lib/client';
    import { assetUrl } from '../../lib/news';

    const list = el('tickets-list') as HTMLElement;
    const kind = (r: any) => (r.status === 'pending' ? 'waiting' : r.status);
    let items: any[] = [];
    let filter = 'all';

    function schedule(event: any) {
      if (!event.startTime) return 'Jadwal Segera Diumumkan';
      const time = (iso: string) => new Date(iso).toLocaleTimeString('id-ID', { hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit', timeZone: 'Asia/Jakarta' });
      const day = formatDate(event.startTime, { weekday: 'long', day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' });
      return event.endTime ? `${day} (${time(event.startTime)} - ${time(event.endTime)} WIB)` : day;
    }

    function printTicket(reg: any, event: any) {
      el('print-event-title').textContent = event.title || 'Judul Acara';
      el('print-name').textContent = reg.name || '-';
      el('print-email').textContent = reg.email || '-';
      el('print-date').textContent = schedule(event);
      el('print-venue').textContent = event.venue || '-';
      el('print-tier').textContent = reg.tier === 'premium' ? 'Paket Premium' : 'Paket Reguler';
      el('print-code').textContent = reg.ticketCode || '-';
      el('print-modal').style.display = 'flex';
    }

    function openMaterials(event: any) {
      el('mat-event-title').textContent = event.title || 'Materi Acara';
      el('mat-list').replaceChildren(...event.materials.map((m: any) => {
        const row = document.createElement('div');
        row.className = 'mat-item-row';
        const info = document.createElement('div');
        info.className = 'mat-info';
        const name = document.createElement('strong');
        name.textContent = m.title;
        const type = document.createElement('span');
        type.textContent = `Format: ${m.type === 'video' ? 'Video Rekaman' : 'Dokumen / Slide'}`;
        info.append(name, type);
        const link = document.createElement('a');
        link.className = 'btn-download-mat';
        link.href = safeHref(assetUrl(m.link || m.filePath));
        link.target = '_blank';
        link.rel = 'noopener noreferrer';
        link.textContent = 'Buka / Unduh ↗';
        row.append(info, link);
        return row;
      }));
      el('material-modal').style.display = 'flex';
    }

    function render() {
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-n]').forEach((n) => {
        n.textContent = String(items.filter((r) => n.dataset.n === 'all' || kind(r) === n.dataset.n).length);
      });
      if (!items.length) return list.replaceChildren(clone('empty-template'));
      list.replaceChildren(...items.filter((r) => filter === 'all' || kind(r) === filter).map((reg) => {
        const event = reg.event || {};
        const status = kind(reg);
        const node = clone('ticket-template');
        node.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-when]').forEach((n) => { if (n.dataset.when !== status) n.remove(); });
        setText(node, '.badge-tier', reg.tier === 'premium' ? 'Paket Premium' : 'Paket Reguler');
        setText(node, '.reg-date', `Didaftarkan: ${formatDate(createdAt(reg))}`);
        const title = node.querySelector('.event-title a') as HTMLAnchorElement;
        title.textContent = event.title || 'Judul Acara Seminar';
        title.href = `/event/${event.slug || ''}`;
        setText(node, '[data-f=date]', schedule(event));
        setText(node, '[data-f=venue]', event.venue || 'Zoom Meeting');
        setText(node, '[data-f=name]', `${reg.name} (${reg.email})`);
        setText(node, '[data-f=total]', reg.totalAmount > 0 ? `Rp ${Number(reg.totalAmount).toLocaleString('id-ID')}` : 'GRATIS');
        setText(node, '.stub-code', reg.ticketCode);
        node.querySelector('.btn-copy-code')!.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
          const btn = e.currentTarget as HTMLElement;
          navigator.clipboard.writeText(reg.ticketCode).then(() => {
            btn.textContent = 'Disalin!';
            setTimeout(() => { btn.textContent = 'Salin'; }, 2000);
          });
        });
        if (status === 'verified') {
          node.querySelector('.status-tip')!.remove();
          node.querySelector('.btn-print-ticket')!.addEventListener('click', () => printTicket(reg, event));
          const cert = node.querySelector('.btn-cert') as HTMLAnchorElement;
          if (event.certificateLink) cert.href = safeHref(event.certificateLink); else cert.remove();
          const mat = node.querySelector('.btn-material') as HTMLElement;
          if (event.materials?.length) mat.addEventListener('click', () => openMaterials(event)); else mat.remove();
        } else setText(node, '.status-tip', status === 'waiting' ? 'Menunggu Approval' : 'Pendaftaran Ditolak');
        return node;
      }));
    }

    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('#ticket-pills .t-pill').forEach((pill) => pill.addEventListener('click', () => {
      document.querySelectorAll('#ticket-pills .t-pill').forEach((p) => p.classList.toggle('active', p === pill));
      filter = pill.dataset.filter!;
      render();
    }));
    el('btn-close-print').addEventListener('click', () => { el('print-modal').style.display = 'none'; });
    el('btn-close-mat').addEventListener('click', () => { el('material-modal').style.display = 'none'; });

    getJSON('/user/tickets').then((res) => { items = res.data || []; render(); })
      .catch(() => { list.textContent = 'Gagal memuat tiket. Silakan coba lagi.'; });
</script>
</UserLayout>

<style>
  .tickets-container {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .dash-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: var(--space-6);
  }

  .header-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .dash-card-title {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }

  .dash-card-subtitle {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Summary Stats */
  .ticket-stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .t-stat-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: var(--space-4);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .t-stat-num {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .t-stat-lbl {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .active-card .t-stat-num { color: #2dc653; }
  .waiting-card .t-stat-num { color: #f4c430; }

  /* Filter Bar */
  .ticket-filter-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .filter-pills {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .t-pill {
    padding: 7px 14px;
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .t-pill.active,
  .t-pill:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #fff;
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .btn-browse-events {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-browse-events:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  /* Ticket Cards (Boarding Pass Layout) */
  .tickets-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .ticket-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 280px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }

  .ticket-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  }

  .ticket-main {
    padding: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .ticket-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ticket-badges {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .t-badge {
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .badge-verified { background: rgba(45, 198, 83, 0.15); color: #2dc653; border: 1px solid #2dc653; }
  .badge-waiting { background: rgba(244, 196, 48, 0.15); color: #f4c430; border: 1px solid #f4c430; }
  .badge-rejected { background: rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.15); color: #e63946; border: 1px solid #e63946; }
  .badge-tier { background: var(--color-surface); color: var(--color-text-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); }

  .reg-date {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .event-title {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .event-title a {
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .event-title a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .event-meta-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-3);
    padding: var(--space-3);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .meta-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .meta-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .meta-value {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ticket-notice {
    padding: var(--space-3);
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .waiting-notice {
    background: rgba(244, 196, 48, 0.1);
    color: #f4c430;
    border: 1px solid rgba(244, 196, 48, 0.25);
  }

  .rejected-notice {
    background: rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.1);
    color: #e63946;
    border: 1px solid rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.25);
  }

  /* Stub / Perforation */
  .ticket-stub {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-left: 2px dashed var(--color-border);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .stub-notch {
    position: absolute;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    background: var(--color-bg-primary);
    border-radius: 50%;
    left: -10px;
  }

  .notch-top { top: -10px; }
  .notch-bottom { bottom: -10px; }

  .stub-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stub-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .stub-code-wrap {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .stub-code {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .btn-copy-code {
    padding: 2px 6px;
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 4px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .barcode-graphic {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3px;
    height: 36px;
    align-items: stretch;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .barcode-graphic span {
    background: var(--color-text-secondary);
    border-radius: 1px;
  }

  .barcode-graphic span:nth-child(even) { width: 4px; }
  .barcode-graphic span:nth-child(odd) { width: 2px; }

  .stub-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
